00:07:09.330 --> 00:07:10.860
I just wanted to share with you

00:07:10.860 --> 00:07:13.630
the top three reasons or top three things

00:07:13.630 --> 00:07:16.200
that I got out of the MBA for myself.

00:07:16.200 --> 00:07:17.033
And I hope, of course,

00:07:17.033 --> 00:07:19.110
this helps potentially also you to decide,

00:07:19.110 --> 00:07:22.100
whether this is something
that makes sense for you too.

00:07:22.100 --> 00:07:25.300
And the first is for
sure, amazing connections.

00:07:25.300 --> 00:07:26.630
So especially the Insead MBA,

00:07:26.630 --> 00:07:29.290
but I trust here also St.
Gallen, it's no different.

00:07:29.290 --> 00:07:31.650
You meet so many people in the MBA program

00:07:31.650 --> 00:07:34.410
from so many different
regions and geographies.

00:07:34.410 --> 00:07:37.550
I know for myself, that
if I all want to travel

00:07:37.550 --> 00:07:40.020
in almost every country in the world,

00:07:40.020 --> 00:07:41.470
it's more less guaranteed,

00:07:41.470 --> 00:07:43.130
that I would know a person there

00:07:43.130 --> 00:07:44.140
or that at least will be able

00:07:44.140 --> 00:07:46.110
to have someone introduce me there

00:07:46.110 --> 00:07:49.410
to a person, to a local, who
can maybe guide me around

00:07:49.410 --> 00:07:51.580
potentially even given
me a place to sleep.

00:07:51.580 --> 00:07:53.130
And of course, this is a network

00:07:53.130 --> 00:07:56.790
that also on the professional
side, is extremely valuable.

00:07:56.790 --> 00:07:59.720
I recently was looking for
contacts at a specific company,

00:07:59.720 --> 00:08:01.510
I was looking that company up on LinkedIn,

00:08:01.510 --> 00:08:04.230
and I saw that several
of my old MBA friends,

00:08:04.230 --> 00:08:05.610
who were working at the company.

00:08:05.610 --> 00:08:06.650
That of course, is huge

00:08:06.650 --> 00:08:08.720
and really a great
opportunity to tap into.

00:08:08.720 --> 00:08:11.530
The second is the MBA being a wild card

00:08:11.530 --> 00:08:12.750
that you can pull out.

00:08:12.750 --> 00:08:15.810
So, frankly, this is not
really the way how I used it,

00:08:15.810 --> 00:08:17.630
but I saw that many other people used it.

00:08:17.630 --> 00:08:19.640
Is that they do the MBA

00:08:19.640 --> 00:08:22.940
because they wanna make
a career transition,

00:08:22.940 --> 00:08:25.630
and this I think is an
opportunity that many people have.

00:08:25.630 --> 00:08:27.710
There may be a work in
a specific industry,

00:08:27.710 --> 00:08:29.870
or maybe a work in a specific function

00:08:29.870 --> 00:08:31.650
and you want to do a switch,

00:08:31.650 --> 00:08:34.210
and to some extent, I
think the MBA is something

00:08:34.210 --> 00:08:36.500
that is used to really reset your career,

00:08:36.500 --> 00:08:39.010
that is often really also
accepted by employers,

00:08:39.010 --> 00:08:40.570
that after you did an MBA,

00:08:40.570 --> 00:08:42.670
do something completely different.

00:08:42.670 --> 00:08:44.190
And this is actually awesome opportunity

00:08:44.190 --> 00:08:47.210
where I see that people
wanna get into consulting,

00:08:47.210 --> 00:08:49.680
maybe in a firm like McKinsey, BCG, Bain.

00:08:49.680 --> 00:08:51.810
So these MBB consulting firms,

00:08:51.810 --> 00:08:55.090
if they have a background
maybe in Big 4, for instance,

00:08:55.090 --> 00:08:59.120
then they can indeed use an
MBA to then also do the switch

00:08:59.120 --> 00:09:00.900
because frankly, it's
sometimes very difficult

00:09:00.900 --> 00:09:02.800
to then transition from MIT consulting

00:09:02.800 --> 00:09:04.870
or from Big 4 to MAB,

00:09:04.870 --> 00:09:05.930
but if you do the MBA,

00:09:05.930 --> 00:09:08.920
this is often a great
opportunity to do exactly that.

00:09:08.920 --> 00:09:11.620
And last but not least, of
course, it's also the learnings,

00:09:11.620 --> 00:09:13.540
and what learnings exactly
what we get out of it

00:09:13.540 --> 00:09:16.400
will also depend on the
type of program that you do.

00:09:16.400 --> 00:09:18.620
So the one thing of
course, are the lectures,

00:09:18.620 --> 00:09:20.060
the input that you get here,

00:09:20.060 --> 00:09:22.300
you of course, it would benefit most

00:09:22.300 --> 00:09:24.810
if you don't have a
business background yet.

00:09:24.810 --> 00:09:25.643
So if you're, for instance,

00:09:25.643 --> 00:09:28.470
an engineer have never
attended a business lecture,

00:09:28.470 --> 00:09:29.310
this would then of course,

00:09:29.310 --> 00:09:31.180
be really great and eye opening for you.

00:09:31.180 --> 00:09:32.013
For me personally,

00:09:32.013 --> 00:09:34.380
I already did have some
business education,

00:09:34.380 --> 00:09:36.150
