in China, for instance,

00:09:50.430 --> 00:09:52.340
the experiences that I did there,

00:09:52.340 --> 00:09:55.230
the cultural sensitivity
that this gave to me

00:09:55.230 --> 00:09:57.080
was really eye opening for me.

00:09:57.080 --> 00:09:58.840
I took so much away from that

